  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hebron Rehabilitation Committee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Irish Representative Office in Ramallah, through the Palestine Head of Mission Fund, will support Hebron Rehabilitation Committee (HRC), aiming to support rehabilitating abandoned wells in Hebron&#x2019;s Old City, ensuring sustainable water access for families facing severe water shortages, especially during the summer months. The project supports the preservation of cultural heritage, as the Old City is a UNESCO World Heritage Site with deep historical and national significance for Palestinians.</narrative>
  </description>
